 "intro_zh": "哈尔·萨夫列尼地下宫殿是一个巨大的地下建筑，建于约公元前2500年，它是利用大型的传动索运输巨石和珊瑚石灰石建造而成。这座地下宫殿可能曾是避难所，但从史前时期起便成为大墓地。",
 "intro_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_en": "The Hypogeum is an enormous subterranean structure excavated c. 2500 B.C., using cyclopean rigging to lift huge blocks of coralline limestone. Perhaps originally a sanctuary, it became a necropolis in prehistoric times.",
 "intro_en_source": "unesco_official",
